									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3311.msg37426#msg37426">Re: University of Florida Student Tasered @ John Kerry Speech</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> September 24, 2007, 12:23:29 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
